Module-level $recording.listen/$liveTranscript.listen in live-copilot.ts ran
at import time; in the single-chunk production bundle a circular import left
those stores undefined -> TypeError ('reading listen') before React mounted ->
blank window in beta.2/beta.3 even with a healthy backend (second half of the
beta.2 blank screen; the bootstrap 404 was the first). Listeners now attach in
initCopilotWiring(), called once from the recorder page mount. 19/19 recorder
tests green.
